    "name": "Cats in Cozy Rooms",
    "steam_appid": 3432590,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <i>Cats in Cozy Rooms</i>!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432590/extras/4ae8ee8f7355614474300dfa59662164.poster.avif?t=1755277231\" width=580 height=478 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432590/extras/4ae8ee8f7355614474300dfa59662164.webm?t=1755277231\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A relaxing, hand-drawn room decorating game where you design beautiful spaces for picky but adorable feline clients!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432590/extras/7a90de9fe86c4eafbe9e5fdfdc312b6f.avif?t=1755277231\" width=600 height=500 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Every Cat Has Its Own Style!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level introduces a new cat with unique likes and dislikes. Some prefer a <strong>rustic</strong> aesthetic, while others love a <strong>more minimalistic</strong> style. Be careful\u2014your client may adore <strong>cozy sofa </strong>but despise <strong>loud music</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432590/extras/b3a71a3734d1dbe9722619db362fb884.avif?t=1755277231\" width=600 height=235 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hand-Drawn Art &amp; Cozy Atmosphere</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy a relaxing experience with beautifully crafted, hand-drawn assets. Every object, cat, and decoration is uniquely illustrated to create a warm and charming world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432590/extras/a1ad8f9a3437e74cf514f5de03293462.poster.avif?t=1755277231\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432590/extras/a1ad8f9a3437e74cf514f5de03293462.webm?t=1755277231\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432590/extras/a1ad8f9a3437e74cf514f5de03293462.mp4?t=1755277231\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Game Made for Creativity &amp; Relaxation</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you want to carefully plan every detail or just have fun designing cute spaces, <i>Cats in Cozy Rooms</i> lets you express your creativity at your own pace!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432590/extras/1bcb023bc66a5f4ac9c10fb32158ad20.avif?t=1755277231\" width=600 height=300 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <i>Cats in Cozy Rooms</i>!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432590/extras/4ae8ee8f7355614474300dfa59662164.poster.avif?t=1755277231\" width=580 height=478 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432590/extras/4ae8ee8f7355614474300dfa59662164.webm?t=1755277231\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A relaxing, hand-drawn room decorating game where you design beautiful spaces for picky but adorable feline clients!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432590/extras/7a90de9fe86c4eafbe9e5fdfdc312b6f.avif?t=1755277231\" width=600 height=500 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Every Cat Has Its Own Style!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level introduces a new cat with unique likes and dislikes. Some prefer a <strong>rustic</strong> aesthetic, while others love a <strong>more minimalistic</strong> style. Be careful\u2014your client may adore <strong>cozy sofa </strong>but despise <strong>loud music</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432590/extras/b3a71a3734d1dbe9722619db362fb884.avif?t=1755277231\" width=600 height=235 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hand-Drawn Art &amp; Cozy Atmosphere</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy a relaxing experience with beautifully crafted, hand-drawn assets. Every object, cat, and decoration is uniquely illustrated to create a warm and charming world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432590/extras/a1ad8f9a3437e74cf514f5de03293462.poster.avif?t=1755277231\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432590/extras/a1ad8f9a3437e74cf514f5de03293462.webm?t=1755277231\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432590/extras/a1ad8f9a3437e74cf514f5de03293462.mp4?t=1755277231\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Game Made for Creativity &amp; Relaxation</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you want to carefully plan every detail or just have fun designing cute spaces, <i>Cats in Cozy Rooms</i> lets you express your creativity at your own pace!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432590/extras/1bcb023bc66a5f4ac9c10fb32158ad20.avif?t=1755277231\" width=600 height=300 /></span></p>",
